WEBVTT

00:00.454 --> 00:01.870
Sasa, hebu tuangalie mlinganyo

00:01.870 --> 00:03.350
wenye mtajo ziadi ya mmoja.

00:03.350 --> 00:08.670
Tuseme tuna mlinganyo a jumlisha--

00:08.670 --> 00:11.620
nitafanya rahisi kidogo, a jumlisha b.

00:11.620 --> 00:17.340
Na nataka kutathmini huu mlinganyo ambapo a ni sawa na 7

00:17.340 --> 00:20.110
na b ni sawa na 2.

00:20.110 --> 00:22.840
Na nakushauri usimamishe hii video na ujaribu kufanya mwenyewe.

00:22.840 --> 00:24.800
Vizuri, popote tutakapoona a, tutabadili

00:24.800 --> 00:26.460
na kuweka 7.

00:26.460 --> 00:30.230
Na popote tutakapoona b, tutabadili na kuweka 2.

00:30.230 --> 00:31.980
Hivyo wakati a ni sawa na 7 na b ni sawa na 2,

00:31.980 --> 00:35.390
huu mlinganyo utakuwa 7 jumlisha 2,

00:35.390 --> 00:38.010
ambayo, bila shaka, ni sawa na 9.

00:38.010 --> 00:40.320
Hivyo huu mlinganyo utakuwa sawa na 9

00:40.320 --> 00:42.190
katika mazingira haya.

00:42.190 --> 00:44.930
Hebu tufanye inayochanganya kidogo.

00:44.930 --> 00:57.920
Hebu tuseme tuna mlinganyo x mara y toa y jumlisha x.

00:57.920 --> 01:00.810
Hebu tufanye jumlisha 3x.

01:00.810 --> 01:04.840
Au njia nyingine unaweza kusema jumlisha 3 mara x.

01:04.840 --> 01:14.936
Hivyo hebu tufanye tathmini wakati x ni sawa na 3 na y ni sawa na 2.

01:14.936 --> 01:17.060
Na kwa mara nyingine, nakushauri usimamishe hii video

01:17.060 --> 01:19.270
na ujaribu kufanya mwenyewe.

01:19.270 --> 01:21.630
Vizuri, popote tunapoona x, tuibadili iwe 3.

01:21.630 --> 01:24.360
Kila sehemu tunapoona y, tuibadili iwe 2.

01:24.360 --> 01:29.810
Hivyo hii itakuwa sawa na 3 mara y.

01:29.810 --> 01:32.180
Na y ni 2.

01:32.180 --> 01:40.710
3 mara 2 toa 2 jumlisha 3 mara x.

01:40.710 --> 01:43.320
Lakini x pia ni sawa na 3.

01:43.320 --> 01:45.330
Kwa hiyo itakuwa sawa na nini?

01:45.330 --> 01:50.620
Vizuri, hii itakuwa sawa na 3 mara 2 ni 6.

01:50.620 --> 01:53.110
Hii 3 mara 3 ni 9.

01:53.110 --> 01:55.860
Hivyo inarahisishwa kwa 6 toa 2, ambayo

01:55.860 --> 01:59.890
ni 4, jumlisha 9, ambayo ni sawa na 13.

01:59.890 --> 02:03.725
Hivyo, itakuwa sawa na 13
